988 </span><span data-lake-id=\"u540a306a\" id=\"u540a306a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">年发布了 </span><span data-lake-id=\"u9d9c1fdc\" id=\"u9d9c1fdc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">POSIX </span><span data-lake-id=\"u91300a34\" id=\"u91300a34\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">标准，即</span><span data-lake-id=\"u687d879f\" id=\"u687d879f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">“</span><span data-lake-id=\"u01494317\" id=\"u01494317\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">可 </span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf58f9c1d\" id=\"uf58f9c1d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u62014c9b\" id=\"u62014c9b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">移植操作系统接口</span><span data-lake-id=\"ue279f6aa\" id=\"ue279f6aa\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">”</span><span data-lake-id=\"uabbe58d3\" id=\"uabbe58d3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">，旨在提供一组公共的 </span><span data-lake-id=\"u45a96311\" id=\"u45a96311\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">API </span><span data-lake-id=\"u1d4d0831\" id=\"u1d4d0831\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">和规范，使得不同的操作系统可以遵循相同的 </span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uaecdd5fb\" id=\"uaecdd5fb\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub4c5abee\" id=\"ub4c5abee\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">标准和接口。这使得开发人员可以编写一次代码，然后在多个不同的平台上运行，从而大大提 </span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u82b64f1b\" id=\"u82b64f1b\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc35a4e12\" id=\"uc35a4e12\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">高了应用程序的可移植性和开发效率。</span></p><table data-lake-id=\"irgjT\" id=\"irgjT\" margin=\"true\" width-mode=\"contain\" class=\"lake-table\" style=\"width: 707px\"><colgroup><col width=\"186\"><col width=\"521\"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id=\"u06e63cc8\" id=\"u06e63cc8\"><td data-lake-id=\"u30fbe2cd\" id=\"u30fbe2cd\"><p data-lake-id=\"u6c2c99d2\" id=\"u6c2c99d2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3708b8bd\" id=\"u3708b8bd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\"> 方面</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u14d86533\" id=\"u14d86533\"><p data-lake-id=\"u77cbaa0d\" id=\"u77cbaa0d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue6e133e3\" id=\"ue6e133e3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\"> 描述</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u6c2c427e\" id=\"u6c2c427e\"><td data-lake-id=\"u8c060cec\" id=\"u8c060cec\"><p data-lake-id=\"u759b3ac8\" id=\"u759b3ac8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2fc3c199\" id=\"u2fc3c199\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\"> 系统调用</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u95ef1ee4\" id=\"u95ef1ee4\"><p data-lake-id=\"uf8706440\" id=\"uf8706440\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubf3dbe50\" id=\"ubf3dbe50\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">进程管理、文件操作、信号处理、进程间通信等方面的操作系统接口</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u9e43f13a\" id=\"u9e43f13a\"><td data-lake-id=\"ubc76f8f0\" id=\"ubc76f8f0\"><p data-lake-id=\"u0caac462\" id=\"u0caac462\"><span data-lake-id=\"u016d3373\" id=\"u016d3373\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">库函数</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u28a4fbcf\" id=\"u28a4fbcf\"><p data-lake-id=\"udcf9ba43\" id=\"udcf9ba43\"><span data-lake-id=\"uce086ecc\" id=\"uce086ecc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">标准 C 库函数和 POSIX 扩展库函数等 </span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u8c677249\" id=\"u8c677249\"><td data-lake-id=\"uea90aff1\" id=\"uea90aff1\"><p data-lake-id=\"u51858218\" id=\"u51858218\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf9aedd39\" id=\"uf9aedd39\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\"> Shell 命令</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u249bab15\" id=\"u249bab15\"><p data-lake-id=\"u1b1b15a5\" id=\"u1b1b15a5\"><span data-lake-id=\"udc319729\" id=\"udc319729\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">包括常用的命令行工具和工具箱，如文件管理、进程管理、网络管理等</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"ud8dd56bd\" id=\"ud8dd56bd\"><td data-lake-id=\"u2320f536\" id=\"u2320f536\"><p data-lake-id=\"u210e3a31\" id=\"u210e3a31\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf4acd2a0\" id=\"uf4acd2a0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">环境变量</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"ufb5799db\" id=\"ufb5799db\"><p data-lake-id=\"u3f269884\" id=\"u3f269884\"><span data-lake-id=\"u16ddcaaa\" id=\"u16ddcaaa\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">定义了一系列操作系统的环境变量，包括 PATH、HOME、USER 等</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u2db53ff1\" id=\"u2db53ff1\"><td data-lake-id=\"uffe092cd\" id=\"uffe092cd\"><p data-lake-id=\"uf7e2ad17\" id=\"uf7e2ad17\"><span data-lake-id=\"uda73d6ba\" id=\"uda73d6ba\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">标准文件</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u00ab80bb\" id=\"u00ab80bb\"><p data-lake-id=\"u358f98b4\" id=\"u358f98b4\"><span data-lake-id=\"uea1ee2dd\" id=\"uea1ee2dd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">定义了标准输入、输出和错误输出等文件描述符</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 data-lake-id=\"LJcVU\" id=\"LJcVU\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucd6e4218\" id=\"ucd6e4218\">man命令</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u62c524b1\" id=\"u62c524b1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub2b8e5d0\" id=\"ub2b8e5d0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">在linux系统中,可以通过man命令查看命令和函数的用法</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22man%20open%5Cnman%202%20open%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HY6us%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u7ae6f875\" id=\"u7ae6f875\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%